  "id": "self-perception",
  "term": "self-perception",
  "definition": "Self-perception is a person’s mental image or idea of themselves, shaped by personal experience, cultural norms, and social interactions. It includes aspects such as self-esteem and self-schemas and influences how people interpret experiences, relate to others, and respond to stress.",
